\\\\ File I/O in Sigi
\\\\ !path_chars !path_len !mode O -> fd
\\\\ !len !fd R -> !bytes !len (the read data)
\\\\ !len !fd !data W -> !bytes_written
\\\\ !fd C -> close

\\\\ Write to file "test.txt"
\\\\ "test.txt" = 8 chars
!116 !101 !115 !116 !46 !116 !120 !116 !8 !1 O :.my_fd
\\\\ "test" = 4 chars
!116 !101 !115 !116 !4 .my_fd H $  \\\\ drop bytes_written
.my_fd Y

\\\\ Read from file
!116 !101 !115 !116 !46 !116 !120 !116 !8 !0 O :.my_fd
!4 .my_fd G $                      \\\\ drop bytes_read
^ ^ ^ ^
.my_fd Y
